// ── Extract Contacts with PRIVATE_ACCEPT Quality Contract ──
// Content source preference: Firecrawl Search markdown (same-item) → else individual Firecrawl Scrape.
// Same-item context only. No Loop URLs / Trigger / cross-node fallback.
// search_private: enforces full PRIVATE_ACCEPT quality gate before persistence.
